    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d591">

                <pb facs="0779" n="685" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg685"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Armstrong to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs informs me that all contracts for Cuban leaf tobacco
                    entered into before publication of order prohibiting its exportation are to be
                    respected and that suggestion in your telegram of 22d has been anticipated.</p>
                <p>Order of the minister for the colonies to Governor-General dated the 8th instant
                    and repeated by telegraph to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armstrong</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Chargé.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
